WEBVTT

01:30.400 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:36.880 --> 01:39.240
I can help you go back in time

01:39.800 --> 01:42.560
and change the course of that girl's life
before she dies.

01:42.640 --> 01:44.160
You can think of a time

01:44.240 --> 01:46.960
and place in the past
that you want to go back to.

01:47.680 --> 01:50.200
I will send you back
with the samsara mirror.

01:50.280 --> 01:51.840
If the Immortals Array hadn't been broken,

01:52.520 --> 01:53.720
it wouldn't have had to be rebuilt,

01:53.800 --> 01:55.720
and in the end, she wouldn't have died.

01:56.560 --> 01:58.480
I will go back to before
the Immortals Array was broken

01:58.560 --> 01:59.480
and stop He Xianwo.

02:08.039 --> 02:09.479
This is the samsara mirror.

02:09.560 --> 02:11.440
Only your spirit can enter

02:11.520 --> 02:13.200
and go back to you in the past.

02:13.720 --> 02:15.280
Once out of your body,

02:15.360 --> 02:16.840
the spirit is unprotected

02:17.360 --> 02:20.000
and will be crushed by the mill of time.

02:21.200 --> 02:22.960
It can be smashed.

02:23.560 --> 02:24.400
Remember,

02:24.920 --> 02:27.080
do not try to change the fate of others

02:27.600 --> 02:29.400
or make your existence known to anyone,

02:29.480 --> 02:33.200
or you will not be able to pay the price,

02:33.280 --> 02:36.200
and countless others
will fall victims to this fate.

02:36.280 --> 02:37.680
The worst that can happen

02:38.280 --> 02:41.840
is that the whole world
will twist and fall apart.

02:41.920 --> 02:43.240
All gone.

02:50.360 --> 02:51.600
I know.

03:20.200 --> 03:22.600
Is he the one I've been waiting for?

03:27.480 --> 03:29.120
-Xuechen.
-Senior.

03:29.200 --> 03:30.560
-Xuechen.
-Xie Xuechen.

03:30.640 --> 03:31.480
-Xuechen.
-Senior.

03:31.560 --> 03:32.440
Xie Xuechen.

03:33.080 --> 03:34.240
Xie Xuechen.

03:36.880 --> 03:37.720
Xie Xuechen.

03:38.240 --> 03:39.720
Xie Xuechen.

03:47.200 --> 03:48.160
Why

03:49.240 --> 03:50.720
are you staring at me like that?

04:08.600 --> 04:09.440
Xuanling.

04:16.920 --> 04:18.040
Xuanling.

04:20.480 --> 04:22.600
I won't put you in any more danger.

04:24.240 --> 04:26.080
I don't want to lose you again.

04:26.160 --> 04:28.720
Xie Xuechen. What's wrong with you?

04:35.440 --> 04:36.400
What happened?

04:40.200 --> 04:42.360
He Xianwo is the Master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

04:42.440 --> 04:44.240
He's going to the Dark Abyss
to break the Immortals Array.

04:44.920 --> 04:47.200
What? How do you know that?

04:47.760 --> 04:49.120
I don't have time to explain.

04:50.960 --> 04:52.360
I must be transported immediately.

05:00.440 --> 05:01.920
Should I call you Master He

05:02.960 --> 05:04.680
or the Master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion?

05:07.680 --> 05:11.080
If I remember correctly,
you've only seen my face once.

05:11.680 --> 05:13.000
Did I give it away,

05:13.080 --> 05:14.440
or

05:15.200 --> 05:16.520
did someone tell you?

05:18.400 --> 05:19.880
Your spirit is calm and stable,

05:20.400 --> 05:21.640
so you are by no means a youth.

05:22.240 --> 05:25.080
There are many cultivators in the world,
but except for the disguise technique,

05:25.160 --> 05:27.680
you're the only one who can do
shapeshift and skin-changing.

05:28.400 --> 05:31.280
-Who are you?
-You not only don't answer my questions

05:31.920 --> 05:33.520
but also want to know something from me.

05:34.200 --> 05:35.160
It doesn't matter.

05:36.000 --> 05:37.520
Whether you answer or not,

05:38.280 --> 05:39.640
I'm going to kill you today.

05:39.720 --> 05:40.840
Coincidentally,

05:41.360 --> 05:42.880
I have the same intention.

05:50.840 --> 05:53.640
You've gotten so much stronger
in a short time.

05:53.720 --> 05:55.440
It's impressive.

06:02.360 --> 06:04.560
I'm kind of hoping he'll succeed

06:05.680 --> 06:09.160
because it'll prove
he's the one I'm waiting for.

06:23.840 --> 06:26.160
Just give me a little more time.
Just a little.

06:26.240 --> 06:28.080
Why now?

06:28.160 --> 06:30.000
It could have been changed.

06:33.800 --> 06:35.520
It failed after all.

06:50.040 --> 06:51.040
Did I succeed?

06:51.560 --> 06:54.160
Unfortunately, reality didn't change,

06:54.680 --> 06:57.240
and the person you love
didn't come back to life.

07:02.040 --> 07:03.800
It could have been changed.

07:04.920 --> 07:06.080
Just a little.

07:07.320 --> 07:10.920
Just give me a little more time,
and I can stop He Xianwo.

07:14.360 --> 07:16.120
Since you promised
to help me return to the past

07:16.200 --> 07:17.640
and change her fate,

07:17.720 --> 07:21.280
why did you suddenly pull me back
to reality at that critical moment?

07:21.360 --> 07:23.400
You misunderstood me.

07:24.360 --> 07:27.360
I didn't bring you back
to reality on purpose.

07:27.440 --> 07:29.040
Time and space are unstable,

07:29.120 --> 07:31.640
so the time you can stay there is limited.

07:31.720 --> 07:34.760
Once the time is up,
you will be forced to return to reality.

07:34.840 --> 07:36.400
Then, how long can I stay in the past?

07:36.480 --> 07:37.640
One day at most.

07:37.720 --> 07:38.760
Only one day?

07:40.240 --> 07:42.920
One day is the limit.

07:46.720 --> 07:48.040
I can endure any amount of pain

07:48.880 --> 07:51.120
as long as I can save her.

07:52.040 --> 07:53.520
The damage to the spirit is irreversible.

07:54.320 --> 07:56.440
Each time you pass through
the Samsara Mirror,

07:56.520 --> 07:59.680
your spirit is weaker than the last,

07:59.760 --> 08:01.080
until it is destroyed.

08:02.280 --> 08:05.800
Even so, will you continue to try?

08:06.440 --> 08:07.480
Yes.

08:08.720 --> 08:10.480
Since your mind is made up,

08:10.560 --> 08:13.160
I will help you again.

08:13.880 --> 08:15.480
Think carefully.

08:16.000 --> 08:19.760
Which point in time
do you want to return to this time?

08:19.840 --> 08:21.400
I've thought about it.

08:30.400 --> 08:31.600
It's only one night.

08:32.159 --> 08:34.840
I have to take Ling out of the Dark Abyss
within that one night.

08:35.799 --> 08:37.880
As long as she is no longer
the Saintess of the Dark Abyss,

08:37.960 --> 08:39.880
she can live peacefully

08:39.960 --> 08:42.400
and will not have to be involved
in what happened later.

08:46.440 --> 08:48.840
At this point,
I was still in seclusion in Snow Cliff,

08:50.040 --> 08:51.800
so I couldn't be seen
coming down the mountain.

08:52.800 --> 08:55.640
Luckily, I learned how to make
an Anti-illusion Hairpin from Ling

08:55.720 --> 08:57.400
and was able to conceal my appearance.

09:11.360 --> 09:15.760
It's been a long time since I've had
one of the Spirit Clan this fresh.

09:15.840 --> 09:17.040
Get lost.

09:17.560 --> 09:18.920
Stupid Dark Clan.

09:23.440 --> 09:25.320
Mister put his life
on the line to save me,

09:25.400 --> 09:27.320
so I must not die here like this.

10:12.960 --> 10:14.360
Don't be afraid, girl.

10:14.960 --> 10:16.720
I'm not your enemy.

10:16.800 --> 10:18.440
You look pathetic,

10:19.040 --> 10:22.080
but you've done so well

10:22.160 --> 10:25.360
that you've survived the hunt
from so many men of the Dark Clan.

10:25.440 --> 10:30.240
You saw me being hunted but didn't help,
so you're not my friend at least.

10:33.760 --> 10:35.320
I made a bet with Ignorance Demon

10:35.400 --> 10:37.600
on which of the group of the Spirit Clan
people His Grace brought back

10:37.680 --> 10:39.600
would survive to the end.

10:40.800 --> 10:43.880
I told him it would be you,
but he didn't believe me.

10:43.960 --> 10:44.960
Now,

10:45.720 --> 10:47.440
while all the other
of the Spirit Clan are dead,

10:47.520 --> 10:48.680
you're the only one who survived.

10:49.280 --> 10:51.080
You're the toughest of them all,

10:51.600 --> 10:53.800
and that's why I admire you.

10:57.320 --> 10:58.400
So,

10:59.960 --> 11:04.400
what gives you
such a strong desire to live?

11:05.120 --> 11:08.040
Countless money

11:08.120 --> 11:11.920
or endless delicacies

11:13.480 --> 11:16.320
or a luxurious wonderland

11:17.800 --> 11:21.560
or supreme power?

11:22.680 --> 11:24.400
I don't care about any of those things.

11:25.240 --> 11:28.520
And what is there
in this world for you to hold on to?

11:28.600 --> 11:30.840
I'm not holding on to this world.

11:32.760 --> 11:35.360
I just don't allow myself
to die like this.

11:35.960 --> 11:38.080
Interesting. Why is that?

11:38.160 --> 11:39.240
None of your business.

11:42.000 --> 11:43.520
Do you find

11:44.040 --> 11:48.240
the Dark Clan so evil and disgusting

11:48.880 --> 11:51.000
that you don't even want to talk to me?

11:51.080 --> 11:52.640
Isn't it true?

11:53.160 --> 11:55.840
You act on your desires and have no sense.

11:59.240 --> 12:01.000
You should be grateful.

12:01.720 --> 12:03.680
Because the Dark Clan is like that,

12:04.200 --> 12:07.120
you have a chance to live
in the Dark Abyss.

12:08.760 --> 12:11.680
The people of the Dark Clan,
whose desires are most obvious,

12:12.280 --> 12:14.440
are the easiest to exploit.

12:14.520 --> 12:17.360
In fact, so are the Humans.

12:17.440 --> 12:21.240
You should not despise desire

12:21.320 --> 12:22.720
but utilize it.

12:23.320 --> 12:28.000
That way, you can manipulate
the Dark Clan and even hearts.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.880
I don't want to be like you.

12:30.600 --> 12:35.040
To survive evil,
you must first become evil.

12:35.120 --> 12:37.560
Only by becoming the ultimate evil

12:38.080 --> 12:39.880
can you fight evil.

12:40.480 --> 12:41.320
Remember that?

12:42.320 --> 12:43.600
Think about it.

12:43.680 --> 12:45.360
Why did you come to the Dark Abyss,

12:45.880 --> 12:47.400
and why are you alive?

12:52.720 --> 12:54.360
Above all,

12:55.280 --> 12:57.120
you have to know what you want

12:57.920 --> 13:00.040
and get what you want.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.440
You're right.

13:05.680 --> 13:06.520
Now,

13:07.720 --> 13:09.760
do I look like a villain?

13:13.560 --> 13:16.600
I'm sure we'll meet again.

13:24.120 --> 13:25.320
I finally found it.

13:36.560 --> 13:39.040
Why would anyone set a trap like this
on their doorstep?

13:52.200 --> 13:54.080
It's a good thing
I'm wearing the Anti-illusion Hairpin.

14:00.040 --> 14:01.960
You shameless Dark Clan people.

14:02.040 --> 14:03.960
You see me as a newcomer.

14:04.040 --> 14:05.760
You guys come to harass me
from time to time.

14:06.800 --> 14:08.600
Luckily, I set the trap in advance.

14:08.680 --> 14:09.960
I was just passing through.

14:10.560 --> 14:13.000
-Who'd believe you?
-Why would I lie to you?

14:13.080 --> 14:15.480
I saw the Xuanling Tree in bloom
when I was passing by,

14:15.560 --> 14:18.160
so I was curious and got closer,

14:18.240 --> 14:19.640
but I didn't expect
to fall into your trap.

14:21.560 --> 14:23.080
You seem to have some aesthetic.

14:24.000 --> 14:25.000
So,

14:26.640 --> 14:27.840
there's a lot of bullying
going on in the Dark Clan?

14:28.880 --> 14:30.200
Of course.

14:30.280 --> 14:31.920
There are no good guys
in the Dark Clan like you,

14:32.000 --> 14:34.200
especially that Ignorance Demon guy.

14:34.280 --> 14:36.840
He's always giving me trouble
and making me uncomfortable.

14:38.640 --> 14:40.160
After I have developed
the most powerful demonic power

14:40.240 --> 14:41.640
and defeated the Dark Clan,

14:41.720 --> 14:44.600
I will make him kneel down
and call me King.

14:46.480 --> 14:48.040
I can't let her go on like this,

14:49.160 --> 14:51.360
or she'll be on her set trajectory again.

14:58.520 --> 14:59.800
Do you want to learn
the great demonic power?

14:59.880 --> 15:00.880
I can teach you.

15:02.240 --> 15:03.640
You?

15:03.720 --> 15:06.400
You even hit my traps,
so how can you teach me?

15:10.480 --> 15:13.160
TWILIGHT SPIRIT PAVILION

15:14.680 --> 15:16.520
How about this? Amazing?

15:17.840 --> 15:20.120
That's good, bro.

15:20.200 --> 15:21.200
I'll give you a pass.

15:21.280 --> 15:22.520
Come on, bro,

15:23.760 --> 15:25.400
-Let's go inside and talk.
-Be gentle.

15:25.480 --> 15:27.040
Be gentle.

15:33.840 --> 15:35.640
Be gentle.

15:45.480 --> 15:48.400
I've only seen her being cocky
in front of the Dark Clan,

15:49.400 --> 15:51.720
but I didn't realize
she was so down on her luck

15:52.440 --> 15:53.920
when she first came to the Dark Abyss.

15:56.080 --> 15:57.520
She said

15:58.040 --> 15:59.960
she had demonic patterns
on her face as a child,

16:00.560 --> 16:02.160
but I didn't see them.

16:02.680 --> 16:04.520
Come on, bro. Have some tea.

16:12.440 --> 16:13.800
What's your amazing power?

16:13.880 --> 16:14.960
Teach me.

16:15.040 --> 16:17.240
I'm going to be more like
the Dark Clan than themselves.

16:17.840 --> 16:19.440
Being like the Dark Clan
is not a good thing.

16:20.040 --> 16:21.280
Why not?

16:21.360 --> 16:25.480
Desire Demon said that joining the ranks
of evil and becoming more than evil

16:25.560 --> 16:28.680
would be one step closer
to destroying the Humans.

16:29.880 --> 16:31.320
Why do you hate the Humans so much?

16:46.040 --> 16:48.920
Don't be blinded by hate
or give up on yourself.

16:49.520 --> 16:50.560
You know what?

16:51.560 --> 16:53.760
There are many bad people in this world,

16:54.640 --> 16:56.360
but there are also
good people, like Mister.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.840
If he were still around,

16:58.920 --> 17:01.840
he'd want you to live simply and happily,
like a normal person.

17:03.280 --> 17:04.880
How do you know Mister?

17:07.960 --> 17:11.520
Stop using those crooked abilities
to read my mind.

17:12.800 --> 17:16.000
I just don't want you to force yourself
to be someone else.

17:16.079 --> 17:18.160
I'm not.

17:18.880 --> 17:21.280
I just want to be
as strong as the Dark Clan.

17:21.359 --> 17:22.560
No.

17:22.640 --> 17:25.640
I want to be stronger
than all the Dark Clans,

17:26.440 --> 17:27.680
and you,

17:28.520 --> 17:30.600
as a Dark Clan,

17:31.120 --> 17:32.240
are so un-Dark-Clan.

17:38.880 --> 17:41.720
If I say I'm not the Dark Clan,
will you come with me?

17:43.520 --> 17:47.120
I would take you to a place
where you could live out your life

17:47.720 --> 17:49.120
without strife or pain.

17:50.960 --> 17:51.800
No.

17:53.040 --> 17:54.040
I want revenge for Mister.

17:55.520 --> 17:57.800
I can only get stronger
if I stay in the Dark Abyss.

17:57.880 --> 18:00.160
Is Mister that important to you?

18:01.040 --> 18:02.600
Do you want to stay in the Dark Abyss,

18:03.120 --> 18:04.760
even though you will
be bullied by the Dark Clan,

18:05.280 --> 18:08.360
live in pain and fear,
and even lose your life?

18:09.080 --> 18:10.320
To me,

18:11.480 --> 18:13.320
Mister is the most important person.

18:14.480 --> 18:15.760
I will suffer

18:16.760 --> 18:18.400
and do anything

18:19.080 --> 18:20.480
for him.

18:28.240 --> 18:29.880
Time is running out.

18:32.560 --> 18:34.440
-Come with me.
-What are you doing?

18:34.520 --> 18:36.640
-You have to get out of here.
-Let go. I've said it. I'm not leaving.

18:39.960 --> 18:41.560
This is a flare from the Dark Abyss.

18:42.080 --> 18:44.720
Once it's fired,
the entire Dark Abyss will go on alert,

18:45.360 --> 18:47.640
and Sang Qi will immediately
bring the Dark Clan after you.

18:48.560 --> 18:50.000
When the time comes,
you will not be able to leave.

18:50.800 --> 18:53.240
I don't care who you are
or what your intentions are,

18:53.840 --> 18:55.240
and I won't expose you,

18:55.320 --> 18:57.760
-but you must leave my house immediately.
-Ling.

18:57.840 --> 18:59.720
If you don't leave, I will fire it.

19:08.880 --> 19:10.320
It will be dawn in the human realm.

19:10.920 --> 19:12.960
I have to get back
to Snow City before then,

19:13.040 --> 19:14.440
or all will be in chaos.

19:14.520 --> 19:15.400
Go.

19:15.920 --> 19:16.760
Now.

19:20.320 --> 19:21.240
Go.

19:29.760 --> 19:33.440
TWILIGHT SPIRIT PAVILION

19:38.560 --> 19:40.320
This time,
I didn't quite get the timing right,

19:40.840 --> 19:44.280
but luckily, my spirit was still alive,
so I still had a chance.

19:51.520 --> 19:53.560
I've been in seclusion
in Snow Cliff for a long time now.

19:54.320 --> 19:56.120
The Swirling Snow Pavilion
had been unused,

19:56.640 --> 19:59.880
so who would be in my place
in the middle of the night?

19:59.960 --> 20:02.200
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

20:17.360 --> 20:18.600
I always thought

20:19.640 --> 20:21.160
that after what happened
in Moonlight Heights,

20:21.680 --> 20:23.440
my father was disappointed in me

20:23.960 --> 20:25.400
and didn't want to see me anymore.

20:26.000 --> 20:27.800
He was so cold that day

20:29.160 --> 20:30.800
when he asked me to leave the mountain,

20:31.920 --> 20:33.240
but why?

20:34.040 --> 20:35.920
If Leader Xie were still around,

20:36.800 --> 20:38.720
he would have wanted to say to you,

20:39.440 --> 20:40.960
"Xuechen,

20:41.040 --> 20:42.960
I've been treating you harshly

20:43.040 --> 20:45.240
for so many years,

20:46.080 --> 20:49.720
but I've always known
how difficult it was for you."

20:53.560 --> 20:54.920
He will never hand over

20:56.000 --> 20:58.400
the Snow City Jade Token even if he dies.

20:58.920 --> 21:03.120
Remember,
do not try to change the fate of others

21:03.200 --> 21:05.520
or make your existence known to anyone,

21:05.600 --> 21:08.920
or you will not be able to pay the price,

21:09.000 --> 21:11.920
and countless others
will fall victims to this fate.

21:12.000 --> 21:13.600
The worst that can happen

21:13.680 --> 21:17.400
is that the whole world
will twist and fall apart.

21:17.480 --> 21:19.000
All gone.

21:26.080 --> 21:27.680
If there is a day in the future

21:27.760 --> 21:30.440
when my life and the human world

21:30.520 --> 21:32.560
are on opposite sides of the fence,

21:33.240 --> 21:34.200
you don't have to worry

21:35.040 --> 21:38.280
and must firmly choose the latter.

22:19.560 --> 22:21.120
Don't be blinded by hate

22:21.840 --> 22:23.360
or give up on yourself.

22:24.280 --> 22:25.320
You know what?

22:25.960 --> 22:28.120
There are many bad people in this world,

22:28.800 --> 22:31.000
but there are also
good people like Mister.

22:31.560 --> 22:33.000
If he were still around,

22:33.720 --> 22:35.920
he'd want you to live simply and happily,

22:36.520 --> 22:37.840
like a normal person.

22:39.960 --> 22:41.880
If it were Mister,

22:44.360 --> 22:46.320
what would he want me to do?

22:46.400 --> 22:50.600
TWILIGHT SPIRIT PAVILION

22:55.480 --> 22:56.560
Time's up.

23:15.440 --> 23:16.360
Ling.

23:19.440 --> 23:20.560
I'm back.

24:10.520 --> 24:11.720
Ling.

24:12.880 --> 24:14.240
You're finally awake.

24:17.480 --> 24:18.800
It's good to see you

24:19.440 --> 24:20.440
again.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.680
Ling.

24:24.000 --> 24:25.040
This time,

24:26.240 --> 24:27.840
we'll never be apart again.

24:29.800 --> 24:30.640
OK.

24:41.160 --> 24:44.640
Now, the war
between man and spirit is over,

24:44.720 --> 24:46.600
and the Immortals Array has been repaired.

24:46.680 --> 24:47.560
The world is at peace.

24:48.240 --> 24:50.200
You promised me you'd take me
to the human world.

24:50.280 --> 24:51.440
Don't go back on your word.

24:52.160 --> 24:54.640
Take me there now, okay?

25:08.400 --> 25:09.240
Okay.

25:26.680 --> 25:27.800
Ling.

25:30.200 --> 25:30.880
Ling.

25:31.680 --> 25:32.440
Mu Xuanling.

25:32.520 --> 25:33.400
Xuanling.

25:42.600 --> 25:43.560
You're awake.

25:47.920 --> 25:50.680
You're very weak now. Don't push yourself.

25:52.680 --> 25:53.600
How is she?

25:55.040 --> 25:58.400
The world remains unchanged.

26:02.080 --> 26:03.280
I'm confused

26:04.840 --> 26:06.120
about one thing.

26:06.720 --> 26:07.720
Ling said

26:09.560 --> 26:11.480
she had large demonic patterns
on her face when she was young,

26:11.560 --> 26:13.280
but I didn't see

26:13.800 --> 26:15.680
any demonic patterns on her face.

26:16.360 --> 26:17.560
Why?

26:17.640 --> 26:19.040
I can't give you an answer.

26:19.120 --> 26:22.840
If you want to know the cause and effect,
you need to find out for yourself.

26:24.720 --> 26:25.560
Let me try again.

26:27.880 --> 26:29.640
Your spirit is severely damaged.

26:29.720 --> 26:32.160
If you force yourself
to time travel again,

26:32.880 --> 26:34.320
you may not make it back.

26:35.720 --> 26:38.000
Even if it's the last hope,

26:38.880 --> 26:40.400
I have to try.

26:53.920 --> 26:55.280
She's still waiting for me.

27:06.320 --> 27:10.000
MOONLIGHT HEIGHTS

27:21.160 --> 27:22.720
Don't be lazy.

27:25.080 --> 27:26.000
Listen up.

27:26.720 --> 27:29.840
Tonight is the birthday party
for the Master's daughter.

27:30.400 --> 27:31.920
Be careful and work hard.

27:32.520 --> 27:36.160
And don't disturb the guests
in the front yard.

27:36.680 --> 27:38.160
Bunch of humble slaves.

27:43.360 --> 27:44.880
The water tank isn't full yet.

27:45.960 --> 27:47.400
Who's in charge here?

27:48.240 --> 27:49.600
It's Ling.

27:50.200 --> 27:53.440
It's freezing these days,
and the river is frozen,

27:53.960 --> 27:56.160
so she has to break the ice to get water.

27:56.240 --> 27:57.280
Stop the bullshit.

28:26.080 --> 28:29.080
Oh my God. You're slacking off again.

28:30.280 --> 28:32.040
What time is it?

28:32.120 --> 28:33.680
The tanks in the yard aren't full yet.

28:34.600 --> 28:35.920
You can spill even these tanks.

28:36.000 --> 28:38.840
You seem to be sneaking around on purpose.

28:39.680 --> 28:40.960
Sir.

28:41.040 --> 28:44.480
I've been picking water all night

28:44.560 --> 28:46.200
and haven't been able to eat,

28:46.720 --> 28:48.440
so I don't have the strength.

28:49.320 --> 28:50.520
Still arguing?

28:51.040 --> 28:53.320
The spirit slave never lacks strength.

28:53.400 --> 28:57.400
I met you, an abandoned baby,
under the tree

28:57.480 --> 28:59.200
and fed you so you could grow up,

29:00.160 --> 29:03.600
but how dare you cheat and be ungrateful?

29:03.680 --> 29:05.880
I think you, a lowly spirit slave,
need to be punished.

29:49.200 --> 29:50.120
Don't be afraid.

30:00.720 --> 30:01.560
Are you feeling cold?

30:03.200 --> 30:04.600
I'm a spirit slave,

30:05.120 --> 30:06.280
and the head says

30:07.040 --> 30:08.680
spirit slaves don't get cold.

30:22.840 --> 30:23.960
Do you feel better?

30:29.600 --> 30:30.920
Who are you?

30:31.000 --> 30:33.920
How dare you hit me? Do you know who I am?

30:39.800 --> 30:42.240
I'm sorry. It's my fault.

30:42.320 --> 30:44.280
This man deserves to die,

30:44.360 --> 30:47.640
but I came here to take Ling away before
Sang Qi's bloodshed in Moonlight Heights

30:47.720 --> 30:50.120
so that she can get rid
of her spirit slave status

30:50.800 --> 30:51.880
and live well.

30:53.120 --> 30:54.720
Killing someone who doesn't matter

30:55.240 --> 30:56.920
will only give me a momentary relief,

30:57.840 --> 30:59.560
but it could end badly.

30:59.640 --> 31:00.680
Spare me.

31:00.760 --> 31:01.800
Get lost.

31:10.720 --> 31:11.720
Will you come with me?

31:13.320 --> 31:16.280
Are you our honored guest?

31:16.800 --> 31:18.200
I'm a spirit slave,

31:19.160 --> 31:21.920
so I'll obey the head.

31:23.000 --> 31:24.440
You're not a spirit slave.

31:30.000 --> 31:31.000
Haven't you eaten yet?

31:31.080 --> 31:35.720
I can't eat until I've filled
all the water tanks in the yard.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.640
I'll take you to a meal.

32:14.480 --> 32:16.720
QIN'S RESTAURANT AND BAR

32:18.800 --> 32:20.200
Good snacks.

32:20.280 --> 32:21.240
Please come again.

32:21.320 --> 32:22.680
-Come inside!
-Best rouge in town!

32:22.760 --> 32:25.960
BRIGHT MOON INN

32:30.800 --> 32:32.600
Don't ever say it doesn't hurt again.

32:33.280 --> 32:34.440
I won't let you get hurt again.

32:40.080 --> 32:43.080
LIQUOR

32:49.520 --> 32:50.440
Here you go, sir.

32:50.520 --> 32:51.600
Thank you.

32:59.640 --> 33:00.960
Enjoy.

33:08.960 --> 33:11.640
There are so many dishes here,
but why do you only have congee?

33:13.160 --> 33:14.920
Congee fills me up.

33:15.000 --> 33:16.920
I used to drink congee all the time.

33:31.920 --> 33:33.320
The dim sum tastes like this.

33:33.400 --> 33:34.640
It's delicious.

33:35.240 --> 33:37.160
It's too inconvenient for you
to eat with your mask on.

33:37.680 --> 33:38.760
Take it off.

33:39.320 --> 33:40.760
No.

33:41.640 --> 33:43.320
I have demonic patterns on my face.

33:43.400 --> 33:45.480
It's ugly. It'll scare you.

33:45.560 --> 33:46.400
It won't.

33:47.640 --> 33:48.640
I knew you'd be beautiful

33:50.680 --> 33:52.640
when I saw your eyes.

34:18.280 --> 34:20.760
So, this is the pattern
from the Chaos Power,

34:21.760 --> 34:23.400
but why would he suddenly disappear?

34:26.040 --> 34:28.719
Does that scare you?

34:31.239 --> 34:32.080
No.

34:34.120 --> 34:35.560
Your demonic patterns are beautiful.

34:36.360 --> 34:38.120
No wonder you didn't want
anyone to see it.

34:41.520 --> 34:42.719
Come on.

34:45.560 --> 34:47.560
This snack is really good.

34:53.639 --> 34:55.600
Why are you being so nice to me?

34:56.920 --> 34:58.800
Do you want me to do something?

35:00.040 --> 35:01.680
You don't have to do anything.

35:03.160 --> 35:04.680
I just want you to be happy.

35:07.680 --> 35:09.920
So, are you

35:11.440 --> 35:13.800
my long-lost father?

35:15.800 --> 35:16.760
Do you hope so?

35:18.120 --> 35:19.680
If so,

35:20.680 --> 35:22.120
that's fine.

35:24.360 --> 35:25.480
Why?

35:25.560 --> 35:26.520
In that case,

35:27.880 --> 35:29.760
you'd take me with you.

35:30.360 --> 35:32.760
You abandoned me for so many years,

35:32.840 --> 35:36.040
so you have to make it up to me.

35:41.880 --> 35:43.280
How do you want me to make it up to you?

35:44.840 --> 35:49.160
I want to wear nice clothes,
eat good food,

35:49.240 --> 35:51.320
live in a big house,

35:51.400 --> 35:53.840
and sleep four hours a day.

35:55.440 --> 35:57.360
Okay. I promise you.

35:58.680 --> 36:00.240
I'll take you dress shopping later,

36:00.320 --> 36:01.840
-okay?
-Okay, Father.

36:02.480 --> 36:03.920
Don't call me Father.

36:05.320 --> 36:08.160
You didn't tell me your name,

36:08.680 --> 36:09.880
so what should I call you?

36:11.120 --> 36:12.600
If she knows my name,

36:13.120 --> 36:14.840
we'll be involved again in the future.

36:15.720 --> 36:17.520
You've already done too much for me,

36:17.600 --> 36:19.960
so I don't want to see you
sacrifice yourself for me again.

36:21.120 --> 36:23.120
I just want you to live a good life,

36:24.480 --> 36:25.600
even if it's no longer me you love.

36:26.880 --> 36:28.520
Anyway, no calling me Father.

36:30.640 --> 36:31.880
Then,

36:34.640 --> 36:35.880
can I call you Mister?

36:42.840 --> 36:43.760
What did you say?

36:44.400 --> 36:45.400
Mister.

36:47.560 --> 36:48.400
It's never me

36:50.120 --> 36:51.640
you're hung up on.

36:52.280 --> 36:54.000
He's my Mister.

36:55.120 --> 36:56.760
He gave me my life.

36:57.560 --> 36:58.680
Mister.

37:03.040 --> 37:04.320
Do you like dim sum so much?

37:04.400 --> 37:06.000
When I was in the human world,

37:06.080 --> 37:07.720
the first thing Mister took me to eat

37:08.520 --> 37:09.800
was dim sum.

37:10.400 --> 37:11.720
So, that's how it is.

37:11.800 --> 37:15.160
The Mister she mentioned
over and over again was me.

37:15.240 --> 37:17.040
All the clues have been there

37:17.920 --> 37:19.240
and obvious for a long time,

37:20.160 --> 37:23.440
but I didn't realize it until now.

37:25.080 --> 37:26.640
What's wrong?

37:26.720 --> 37:29.680
Does it bother you
that I called you Mister?

37:32.640 --> 37:34.360
-No.
-So,

37:34.440 --> 37:36.760
can I call you Mister?

37:44.520 --> 37:45.520
Okay.

37:46.920 --> 37:48.160
Mister.

37:51.160 --> 37:52.040
Ling.

38:03.280 --> 38:06.240
Mister. Thank you for taking me
to the medical center for treatment

38:06.320 --> 38:08.080
and buying me new clothes.

38:09.720 --> 38:12.080
The clothes are nice. I like it.

38:14.560 --> 38:15.760
I'm glad you like it.

38:20.920 --> 38:22.880
Today is the Timekeeper Festival.

38:23.880 --> 38:26.800
They say it's for the Chaos Pearl.

38:27.520 --> 38:29.480
They say that 6,000 years ago,

38:29.560 --> 38:31.760
the Immortal Alliance
used the power of the Chaos Pearl

38:31.840 --> 38:33.360
to build the Immortals Array

38:34.280 --> 38:37.040
to keep the human realm
safe from the Dark Clan.

38:41.640 --> 38:42.800
But in fact,

38:43.640 --> 38:45.960
the Humans never asked
the Chaos Pearl what she wanted

38:46.040 --> 38:49.200
or if she was willing to be sacrificed.

38:50.080 --> 38:53.440
Isn't the Chaos Pearl a pearl?

38:54.200 --> 38:55.040
Does it talk?

39:00.800 --> 39:03.000
Mister. What's wrong with you?

39:04.080 --> 39:06.560
Are you sad?

39:09.240 --> 39:10.760
As long as you're happy,

39:11.280 --> 39:12.360
I'm not sad.

39:21.760 --> 39:24.040
If only we could watch fireworks together

39:24.120 --> 39:26.400
like this at future Timekeeper Festivals.

39:27.440 --> 39:29.760
-This is amazing.
-Indeed.

39:32.360 --> 39:33.880
I'm just saying.

39:34.600 --> 39:37.360
It's okay if we don't

39:37.440 --> 39:39.000
get a chance like this.

39:40.120 --> 39:44.400
The head doesn't allow us
to celebrate the Humans' festival.

39:45.440 --> 39:46.800
Because we're spirit slaves.

39:49.960 --> 39:52.280
No. I'll take you away.

39:54.200 --> 39:56.000
Every Timekeeper Festival from now on,

39:57.120 --> 39:59.000
you'll be able to see the fireworks.

40:00.680 --> 40:01.840
Really?

40:05.720 --> 40:06.840
Thank you.

40:12.400 --> 40:13.360
Ling.

40:14.240 --> 40:15.280
I'm sorry.

40:16.480 --> 40:18.800
Taking you away
and staying with you are different.

40:19.640 --> 40:21.520
If you stay with Xie Xuechen,

40:22.040 --> 40:23.880
there will still be unknown risks.

40:25.080 --> 40:26.480
I will take you away,

40:27.120 --> 40:28.160
but in the future,

40:28.760 --> 40:30.160
you must be on your own,

40:30.760 --> 40:31.800
forget about me,

40:32.400 --> 40:33.360
and live well.

40:44.960 --> 40:46.680
I'd love to take you now,

40:47.520 --> 40:50.760
but the Spirit Lock on your foot
restricts your range of motion,

40:51.360 --> 40:52.720
so if we force our way out,

40:53.560 --> 40:54.800
it will jeopardize your life.

40:56.320 --> 40:59.360
It's only been one day,
but I'm very happy,

41:00.120 --> 41:03.480
so, Mister, you don't have to lie to me.

41:03.560 --> 41:06.760
Even if you really can't take me with you,
I won't blame you.

41:08.600 --> 41:10.040
I'm not lying to you.

41:10.560 --> 41:11.680
I really want to take you away…

41:11.760 --> 41:12.480
MOONLIGHT HEIGHTS

41:12.560 --> 41:14.520
…so I'm going to go to Mr. Gao

41:14.600 --> 41:15.760
and ask him to unlock
the Spirit Lock for you.

41:16.360 --> 41:17.400
Really?

41:19.760 --> 41:22.160
But Mr. Gao
is in the Spiritual Form stage,

41:22.680 --> 41:23.960
very powerful.

41:24.720 --> 41:28.080
If you can't, don't push yourself.

41:42.120 --> 41:43.240
Don't worry.

41:44.720 --> 41:46.280
I'll get you out of here.

41:55.360 --> 41:57.920
Master. Mr. Xie from Snow City
wants to see you.

42:00.200 --> 42:01.600
Xie Xuechen?

42:02.600 --> 42:04.320
Why is he here all of a sudden?

42:07.600 --> 42:09.120
-Let him in.
-Yes, sir.

42:16.200 --> 42:17.480
I envy her.

42:17.560 --> 42:19.800
-Her brand birthday party every year.
-Get to work.

42:19.880 --> 42:21.080
But we have to work hard every time.

42:21.160 --> 42:24.000
We work from morning
till night for this day.

42:24.080 --> 42:25.040
That's enough.

42:25.120 --> 42:27.120
We are the Spirit Clan
who are born inferior.

42:27.200 --> 42:28.960
At least we don't starve
in Moonlight Heights.

42:29.040 --> 42:31.320
Sang Qi bloodied
Moonlight Heights that year

42:31.400 --> 42:33.000
on Gao Qiumin's birthday.

42:33.080 --> 42:34.760
So, it's tonight?

42:35.640 --> 42:37.640
Sang Qi has been planning
this battle for years,

42:38.160 --> 42:40.080
so stopping him is almost impossible.

42:40.720 --> 42:42.880
What happened to Feng Xiang
is still fresh in my mind,

42:43.600 --> 42:45.080
and the samsara mirror
has repeatedly told me

42:45.600 --> 42:47.280
not to change the trajectory of the past.

42:48.240 --> 42:50.360
As long as I can take Ling away
before it happens

42:50.880 --> 42:52.560
and prevent her from
being caught by Sang Qi,

42:53.080 --> 42:54.960
I will have achieved
the purpose of my trip.

42:57.360 --> 43:00.840
This man has done so many dirty deeds
and is very cunning,

43:01.520 --> 43:03.520
so I have to be careful in front of him

43:04.120 --> 43:06.480
and not let him find out
that Ling is the Chaos Pearl.
